    "title": "MICROSERVICE-development-commerce-platform-api-Create Api Cart Coupon-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Cart Coupon Management API allows users to apply promotional coupons to their shopping carts, enhancing the customer shopping experience. This endpoint enables the submission of coupon codes against a specified cart, thereby adjusting the total price based on applicable discounts. Typical consumers of this API include e-commerce platforms, payment service providers, and marketing tools looking to manage coupon integration seamlessly. By utilizing this API, businesses can efficiently promote sales and manage customer discounts directly at the point of purchase.",
